WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
- So Kimberly, so on the new song,

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.760
someone told me that you
guys used mouth trumpets

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.520
on this song, and I can actually hear it,

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.250
especially at the end,
one of the last ones.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.900
So care to explain how that happened

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.235
and was wine, beer, or whiskey involved?

00:00:13.235 --> 00:00:15.050
(laughing)

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:15.883
- Absolutely.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.170
(mouth trumpet noise)

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.683
- I think Jimmy has
the best mouth trumpet.

00:00:24.683 --> 00:00:27.030
(mouth trumpet noise)

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:28.060
- I can't do that.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.965
Did y'all all do it?

00:00:29.965 --> 00:00:30.798
- Yeah.

00:00:30.798 --> 00:00:31.869
- Yes.

00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:33.060
Some trumpets are better than others.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.630
- We considered leaving it like that.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:38.420
- You can hear the mouth
trumpet at the end though.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.470
At the very end

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:40.350
that's the best part,

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.790
and it's like, I want to go to that party

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.560
where at the end I feel
like I'm so awesome

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.310
I can play a trumpet with my mouth.

00:00:46.235 --> 00:00:48.560
- Well, we were gonna
keep the mouth trumpets,

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.230
but we decided to add
Jacob from The Brummies,

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.408
a great little band,

00:00:53.408 --> 00:00:56.750
and he played trumpet on the record,

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.310
so we were like, we gotta have both.

00:00:58.310 --> 00:00:59.143
- I love it.

00:00:59.143 --> 00:01:00.370
The vibe is so cool, guys,

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.370
like how the song starts out.

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:02.450
It's like, where is this going?

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.672
Like, and then it, how it ends.

00:01:03.672 --> 00:01:05.560
It literally is so cool.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:06.620
That's what I love about your,

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:09.070
you're so adventurous and you
play with different genres,

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:10.350
and it's just really,

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:12.210
it's really, really
cool to be a fan of you

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:13.669
and how y'all are unafraid of that.

00:01:13.669 --> 00:01:16.270
It's nice to go on the ride with y'all.

